                    Toeca 551, <hi rendition="#italic">supra</hi>;
                        Toeca 611, not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d151-f3" n="3" xml:id="d151-f3-content">
                <p>For documentation concerning the size and presentation of the British defense
                    budget, see <ref target="frus1951v04p1">volume <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >iv</hi>
                    </ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
